----Ways to use CCS
      bio-energy with CCS:-trees absorb CO2--> cut trees to drive(❌ CCS)-->CO2 released during industrial process(carbon neutral)
                              during this process, the increasing of CO2 is zero. Because the trees previously captured some CO2 from the atomsphere, and then released it back again after the industrial processing.
                          -trees absorb CO2--> cut trees to drive(✅ CCS)-->CO2 is collected and sent to geological storage (carbon nagative)
                              during this process, the difference from before is that the CO2 is stored in deep underground.
