----DAC
    filter out the carbon dioxide from the air
        when filter is saturated, the filter would be heated to 100 degree C, let the co2 released and send to geological storage.
            detail of sending: the DAC would help by geothermal energy facility.  The facility would use the water, which temperature is not high(low temperature high dissolve rate of the gas), to render the gas dissolved in it. After that, bumping the solution into the deep underground. The solution is reacted with a particular type of rock.(mineralisation)

